{{ 'raqi-redesign.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- comment -%}
  2026-09-03: the out-of-stock card treatment, shared by every card surface.

  Lives here rather than in assets/raqi-redesign.css or assets/raqi-theme.css so
  both shared stylesheets stay untouched, and so ONE rule set covers all four
  surfaces that render a product card — the homepage grid and the collection
  grid (.rd-card, via snippets/rd-product-card.liquid), the "Selected this
  season" carousel (sections/raqi-selected.liquid, which inlines its own card
  markup) and the product page's related row (snippets/raqi-product-card.liquid)
  — instead of the same rules being pasted into four section style blocks and
  drifting apart.

  The badge is a SIBLING of the image, never a child. The dimming below is an
  opacity, and opacity on a parent fades its children with it, so a badge nested
  inside the media would be the one element guaranteed to go unreadable.

  The two card systems use different token sets (--rd-* for the redesign,
  --raqi-* for the older Raqi system), so geometry is shared and only the
  colours and face are split.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% style %}
  .rd-card__media,
  .raqi-product-card__media { position: relative; }

  .rd-card__oos,
  .raqi-product-card__oos {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-start: 0;
    inset-inline: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 6px 4px;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .rd-card__oos {
    font-family: var(--rd-body);
    background: var(--rd-ink);
    color: var(--rd-bone);
  }

  .raqi-product-card__oos {
    font-family: var(--raqi-font-body);
    background: var(--raqi-ink);
    color: var(--raqi-bg-page);
  }

  .rd-card--oos .rd-card__media img,
  .raqi-product-card--oos .raqi-product-card__media img {
    opacity: 0.34;
    filter: grayscale(1);
  }

  .rd-card--oos .rd-card__brand,
  .rd-card--oos .rd-card__name,
  .rd-card--oos .rd-card__price,
  .rd-card--oos .rd-card__tier,
  .raqi-product-card--oos .raqi-product-card__brand,
  .raqi-product-card--oos .raqi-product-card__name,
  .raqi-product-card--oos .raqi-product-card__sizes,
  .raqi-product-card--oos .raqi-product-card__price {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
{% endstyle %}
